t so permanent if you lose your tank in battle. Can you keep the same tank for the entire game?<br></li><li><strong>EXIT YOUR TANK</strong> for a quick spot of repair or jet-pack to a new tank and take control. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523030/extras/ad2229833ebf254623f98fcefbb02a4e.poster.avif?t=1555027375\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523030/extras/ad2229833ebf254623f98fcefbb02a4e.webm?t=1555027375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523030/extras/ad2229833ebf254623f98fcefbb02a4e.mp4?t=1555027375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>ATTACK-DEFEND-CAPTURE.</strong> Take the fight to the enemy or defend your base from epic waves of enemy tanks and other vehicles. <br></li><li><strong>CUSTOM BATTLE BUILDER.</strong> Select your battleground and the strength of the forces that are to clash. Then hit start to place yourself in the heat of the battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523030/extras/7ed375650f63f0c0ed8b047733e28e13.poster.avif?t=1555027375\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523030/extras/7ed375650f63f0c0ed8b047733e28e13.webm?t=1555027375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523030/extras/7ed375650f63f0c0ed8b047733e28e13.mp4?t=1555027375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul></li></ul>",
